flowchart TD
    Start([P0 Incident Detected]) --> Assess{Severity<br/>Assessment}
    Assess -->|Confirmed P0| Declare[Declare P0 Incident<br/>Create War Room]
    Assess -->|Lower Priority| Lower[Use P1/P2 Playbook]
    
    Declare --> Team[Assemble Response Team<br/>- Incident Commander<br/>- Technical Lead<br/>- Comms Lead]
    Team --> Notify[Notify Stakeholders<br/>- Engineering<br/>- Leadership<br/>- Support]
    
    Notify --> StatusPage[Update Status Page<br/>Major Outage]
    StatusPage --> Diagnose{Rapid<br/>Diagnosis}
    
    Diagnose -->|Database| DB[Database Failover<br/>or Scaling]
    Diagnose -->|Application| App[Rollback Deployment<br/>or Restart Services]
    Diagnose -->|Infrastructure| Infra[Scale Resources<br/>or Failover Region]
    Diagnose -->|Unknown| Protect[Enable Circuit Breakers<br/>Maintenance Mode]
    
    DB --> Monitor[Monitor Metrics<br/>- Error Rate<br/>- Response Time<br/>- User Impact]
    App --> Monitor
    Infra --> Monitor
    Protect --> Monitor
    
    Monitor --> Resolved{Issue<br/>Resolved?}
    Resolved -->|No After 30min| Escalate[Escalate &<br/>Deeper Diagnosis]
    Escalate --> Diagnose
    
    Resolved -->|Yes| Verify[Verify Resolution<br/>- All Services Healthy<br/>- Error Rate Normal<br/>- User Testing]
    
    Verify --> Stable{Stable<br/>2+ Hours?}
    Stable -->|No| Monitor
    Stable -->|Yes| CommCustomer[Customer Communication<br/>Incident Resolved]
    
    CommCustomer --> Document[Document Timeline<br/>& Actions Taken]
    Document --> Close[Close Incident<br/>Update Status Page]
    Close --> PM[Schedule Post-Mortem<br/>Within 5 Days]
    PM --> End([Incident Complete])
    
    style Start fill:#ff6b6b,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#fff
    style Declare fill:#ff8787,stroke:#c92a2a
    style Diagnose fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#f59f00
    style Resolved fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#f59f00
    style Stable fill:#ffd93d,stroke:#f59f00
    style End fill:#90ee90,stroke:#2f9e44,color:#000
